---
const videoUrl = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/videos/climate-atlas-hero.mp4`;
---

<header class="hero relative isolate mb-[22px] flex min-h-[clamp(560px,72vh,760px)] overflow-hidden rounded-[14px] bg-[#0d1720] text-white">
  <video
    class="absolute inset-0 -z-30 size-full object-cover"
    autoplay
    muted
    loop
    playsinline
    preload="metadata"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <source src={videoUrl} type="video/mp4" media="(prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference)" />
  </video>

  <div class="hero-wash absolute inset-0 -z-20"></div>
  <div class="hero-vignette absolute inset-0 -z-10"></div>

  <div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center px-6 pt-[clamp(72px,13vh,136px)] pb-8 text-center sm:px-10 sm:pb-10">
    <div class="max-w-[820px]">
      <p class="mb-5 font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] text-[#9ec5f4] uppercase sm:text-xs">
        217 countries · 34 years · one shared atmosphere
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-[clamp(42px,8vw,88px)] leading-[0.95] font-bold tracking-[-0.04em] text-balance">
        See how the world is changing.
      </h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-[62ch] text-[clamp(16px,2vw,20px)] leading-relaxed text-[#e1e8ed] text-balance">
        Explore the relationship between emissions, energy, prosperity, and population across more than three decades of global change.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-auto flex w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 pt-12 sm:flex-row">
      <a
        href="https://ourworldindata.org/donate"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="hero-button hero-button-primary group inline-flex min-h-12 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white no-underline sm:w-auto"
        aria-label="Donate to Our World in Data (opens in a new tab)"
      >
        Donate
        <svg aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
          <path d="M6 14 14 6M8 6h6v6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a
        href="#controlsPanel"
        class="hero-button inline-flex min-h-12 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-white/45 bg-black/20 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white no-underline sm:w-auto"
      >
        Explore the atlas
        <svg aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-y-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
          <path d="m5 8 5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .hero {
    box-shadow: 0 28px 70px -36px rgb(3 15 25 / 0.8);
  }

  .hero-wash {
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(3 12 20 / 0.42) 0%, rgb(3 12 20 / 0.16) 42%, rgb(3 12 20 / 0.88) 100%),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(3 12 20 / 0.36), transparent 36%, transparent 64%, rgb(3 12 20 / 0.36));
  }

  .hero-vignette {
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 120px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.28);
  }

  .hero-button {
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px -16px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.7);
    transition:
      transform 280ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
      background-color 280ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
      border-color 280ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
      box-shadow 280ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .hero-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.78);
    background-color: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.36);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 38px -16px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.82);
  }

  .hero-button-primary:hover {
    background-color: #256abf;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero video { display: none; }
    .hero-button,
    .hero-button svg { transition: none; }
  }
</style>
